---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Banner Settings">
  <div class="docs-content">
    <h1>Banner Settings</h1>

    <h2>Scheduler</h2>
    <p>Configure when your banner appears:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Permanent visibility</strong> - Always visible (default)</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Date range</strong> - Set specific start and end dates/times
        <ul>
          <li>Start date: Day/Month/Year and Hour</li>
          <li>End date: Day/Month/Year and Hour</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-tip">
      <p><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> Schedule banners in advance for holiday sales, product launches, or time-limited promotions to automate your marketing campaigns.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Display Options</h2>
    <p>Customize banner appearance:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Animation type selection</li>
      <li>Animation speed control</li>
      <li>Show/hide navigation arrows</li>
      <li>Show/hide navigation dots</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-note">
      <p><strong>Note:</strong> Choose animations that match your brand style. Subtle animations often perform better than flashy ones.</p>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <h2>Playback Options</h2>
    <p>Control banner interaction:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Auto-play</strong> - Enable/disable automatic slide progression</li>
      <li><strong>Pause on hover</strong> - Stop animation when mouse hovers over banner</li>
      <li><strong>Loop</strong> - Continuous playback of slides</li>
      <li><strong>Interval time</strong> - Duration each slide is displayed</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="docs-info">
      <h3>Recommended Settings</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Interval time:</strong> 5-7 seconds per slide gives users enough time to read content</li>
        <li><strong>Pause on hover:</strong> Enable this to let users control their viewing experience</li>
        <li><strong>Auto-play:</strong> Great for hero banners, but consider disabling for informational content</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr />

    <div class="mt-12 flex gap-4">
      <a href="/docs/slide-types" class="btn bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-300">
        ← Previous: Slide Types
      </a>
      <a href="/docs/placement" class="btn btn-primary">
        Next: Banner Placement →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
